# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 7 Audio — frontend configuration.
#
# Copy to .env.production.local for real builds, or .env.development.local for
# local work against a dev backend. Vite loads .env.local in EVERY mode, so a
# localhost URL left there would be baked into a production bundle — use the
# mode-specific names instead. ONLY public values belong in this file:
# anything with VITE_ in the name is compiled into the JavaScript bundle and
# is readable by anyone. Client secrets, the Cashfree secret key and the
# webhook secret live in the SERVER environment (see server/.env.example)
# and must never appear here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Base URL of the 7By backend. Leave empty to run with no accounts at all —
# every free tool still works, sign-in and credits are hidden.
VITE_AUDIORA_API=

# Google OAuth *client ID*. Public by design; the client SECRET stays on the
# server. Leave empty to hide the Google button.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
